{"schemaVersion":1,"objectId":"fund006213","records":[{"id":"1802051996","objectId":"fund006213","title":"股债跷跷板再次上演，资金来回流转。债基是我的底仓，今天走势不激进，胜在踏实。不跟","url":"https://guba.eastmoney.com/news,of006213,1802051996.html","date":"2026-11-26","publishedAt":"2026-11-26 14:59:48","source":"东方财富股吧","readCount":38,"commentCount":0,"content":null,"coverage":{"comments":"partial","fetchedComments":0},"boardVerified":true,"nativeBoard":"of006213","comments":[]},{"id":"1802004382","objectId":"fund006213","title":"今天全市场也就利率债稍微争点气，盘中小幅反弹，把跌幅收窄了一点，算是今天唯一的安","url":"https://guba.eastmoney.com/news,of006213,1802004382.html","date":"2026-11-26","publishedAt":"2026-11-26 14:28:51","source":"东方财富股吧","readCount":44,"commentCount":0,"content":"今天全市场也就利率债稍微争点气，盘中小幅反弹，把跌幅收窄了一点，算是今天唯一的安慰。反观信用债，一点起色都没有。连着跌了这么久，行情反反复复不稳，我也慢慢想通了，干脆不折腾，先躺平观望。$东方臻选纯债债券C(OTCFUND|006213)$","coverage":{"comments":"complete","fetchedComments":0,"body":"complete","reportedComments":0,"commentSource":"embedded-page","bodySource":"html-body","contentTruncated":false},"boardVerified":true,"nativeBoard":"of006213","comments":[]},{"id":"1801890210","objectId":"fund006213","title":"债市今天不顺畅，看长期","url":"https://guba.eastmoney.com/news,of006213,1801890210.html","date":"2026-11-26","publishedAt":"2026-11-26 13:25:14","source":"东方财富股吧","readCount":34,"commentCount":1,"content":"今天债这边不算顺畅，多数品种收益率上行，少数小幅回调。不用焦虑，债的作用是平衡组合，稳住托底就挺好。#11月基金投资策略# $东方臻选纯债债券C(OTCFUND|006213)$","coverage":{"comments":"complete","fetchedComments":1,"body":"complete","reportedComments":1,"commentSource":"embedded-page","bodySource":"html-body","contentTruncated":false},"boardVerified":true,"nativeBoard":"of006213","comments":[{"id":"9983898060","text":"看着连续绿确实难受，谁都不想看到账户缩水，只能慢慢熬，等行情缓过来。","at":"2026-11-26 14:20:26","replyTo":""}]},{"id":"1801847009","objectId":"fund006213","title":"我熬了一上午只盼午后回暖","url":"https://guba.eastmoney.com/news,of006213,1801847009.html","date":"2026-11-26","publishedAt":"2026-11-26 12:19:29","source":"东方财富股吧","readCount":53,"commentCount":1,"content":"熬完一上午，市场还是一副提不起劲的样子。全程震荡磨底，没有半点反弹气势，能不能回暖全看下午。债市今天更糟，中长端利率债持续走跌，越跌越狠。不奢望大反弹，只求午后稍微拉回来一点，把跌幅收一收，能少亏，就已经很不错了。","coverage":{"comments":"complete","fetchedComments":1,"body":"complete","reportedComments":1,"commentSource":"embedded-page","bodySource":"html-body","contentTruncated":false},"boardVerified":true,"nativeBoard":"of006213","comments":[{"id":"9983846339","text":"拿着债慢慢等，隔壁热闹总有散场的时候，到时候说不定就回来了。","at":"2026-11-26 13:27:42","replyTo":""}]}]}
